<p>This model works well for direct client interactions but doesn't scale e=
fficiently for event-driven scenarios where multiple storage systems need t=
o trigger processing based on file events.</p>
<h3 id=3D"AI-284:AI+RabbitMQIntegration-HybridHTTPandRabbitMQProcessing">Hy=
brid HTTP and RabbitMQ Processing</h3>
<p>The enhanced architecture introduces RabbitMQ as an additional trigger m=
echanism while preserving the HTTP interface:</p>
