<h3 id=3D"AI-284:AI+RabbitMQIntegration-MessageProcessingGuarantees">Messag=
e Processing Guarantees</h3>
<p>To ensure at-most-once processing, the system implements a careful ackno=
wledgment strategy:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence"># Pseud=
ocode for message processing in Notification API
async def process_message(channel, method, properties, body):
    try:
        # 1. Parse and validate message
        message =3D parse_message(body)
        validate_message(message)
       =20
        # 2. Extract event details
        event_name =3D message.get('eventName')
        s3_object =3D message.get('source', {}).get('s3object', {})
       =20
        # 3. Check configuration for routing
        services =3D get_services_for_file(s3_object['bucket'], s3_object['=
key'])
       =20
        # 4. Generate unique job ID
        job_id =3D generate_job_id()
       =20
        # 5. Acknowledge message BEFORE forwarding
        channel.basic_ack(delivery_tag=3Dmethod.delivery_tag)
       =20
        # 6. Forward to AI+ services via HTTP
        for service in services:
            await forward_to_service(service, job_id, message)
           =20
    except ValidationError:
        # Invalid message - reject without requeue
        channel.basic_reject(delivery_tag=3Dmethod.delivery_tag, requeue=3D=
False)
    except Exception as e:
        # Temporary failure - reject with requeue
        channel.basic_reject(delivery_tag=3Dmethod.delivery_tag, requeue=3D=
True)
</pre>
</div>
</div>
