<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">Main Qu=
eue =E2=94=80=E2=94=80X=E2=94=80=E2=94=80&gt; Processing Failed =E2=94=80=
=E2=94=80&gt; Dead Letter Exchange
                                               =E2=94=82
                                               =E2=96=BC
                                        Dead Letter Queue
                                               =E2=94=82
                                               =E2=96=BC
                                        Manual Investigation
</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h2 id=3D"AI-284:AI+RabbitMQIntegration-MonitoringandObservability">Monitor=
ing and Observability</h2>
<h3 id=3D"AI-284:AI+RabbitMQIntegration-Metrics">Metrics</h3>
<p>The system tracks essential metrics for operational visibility:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence"># Metri=
cs collection example
class QueueMetrics:
    def __init__(self):
        self.queue_depth =3D Gauge('rabbitmq_queue_depth', 'Current queue d=
epth')
        self.message_age =3D Histogram('rabbitmq_message_age_seconds', 'Age=
 of messages when processed')
        self.processing_duration =3D Histogram('job_processing_duration_sec=
onds', 'Job processing time')
        self.messages_published =3D Counter('rabbitmq_messages_published_to=
tal', 'Total messages published')
        self.messages_consumed =3D Counter('rabbitmq_messages_consumed_tota=
l', 'Total messages consumed')
        self.messages_failed =3D Counter('rabbitmq_messages_failed_total', =
'Total messages failed')
        self.routing_decisions =3D Counter('notification_api_routing_total'=
, 'Routing decisions by service')
</pre>
</div>
</div>
