</div>
<h2 id=3D"AI-284:AI+RabbitMQIntegration-ClassResponsibilities">Class Respon=
sibilities</h2>
<h3 id=3D"AI-284:AI+RabbitMQIntegration-NotificationAPI"><strong>Notificati=
on API</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Role</strong>: Entry point for S3 events:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Receives S3 events via HTTP endpoints</p></li>
<li>
<p>Validates event data</p></li>
<li>
<p>Publishes events to RabbitMQ exchange</p></li>
<li>
<p>Maintains single point of message origin</p></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Key Methods</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><code>handle_file_created()</code> - Processes S3 FileCreated events</p>=
</li>
<li>
<p><code>handle_file_moved()</code> - Processes S3 FileMoved events</p></li=
>
<li>
<p><code>publish_s3_event()</code> - Publishes to RabbitMQ exchange</p></li=
>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"AI-284:AI+RabbitMQIntegration-BaseHandler(BaseHandler)"><strong>B=
aseHandler</strong> (<code>BaseHandler</code>)</h3>
<p><strong>Role</strong>: Base RabbitMQ infrastructure:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>RabbitMQ connection management</p></li>
<li>
<p>Exchange and queue setup</p></li>
<li>
<p>Message consumption with at-most-once delivery</p></li>
<li>
<p>Health monitoring and metrics</p></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Key Methods</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><code>start()</code> - Initialize connection and consumers</p></li>
<li>
<p><code>process_message()</code> - Abstract method for message processing<=
/p></li>
<li>
<p><code>publish_message()</code> - Publish messages to exchanges</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"AI-284:AI+RabbitMQIntegration-AIServiceHandler(MetagenHandler)"><=
strong>AI Service Handler</strong> (<code>MetagenHandler</code>)</h3>
<p><strong>Role</strong>: Service-specific RabbitMQ handling:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Inherits from <code>RabbitMQBaseHandler</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>Routes messages to appropriate processors</p></li>
<li>
<p>Manages job lifecycle</p></li>
<li>
<p>Publishes status updates and results</p></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Key Methods</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><code>process_message()</code> - Main message processing entry point</p>=
</li>
<li>
<p><code>_handle_file_created()</code> - Handle FileCreated events</p></li>
<li>
<p><code>_handle_file_moved()</code> - Handle FileMoved events</p></li>
<li>
<p><code>publish_status()</code> - Publish job status updates</p></li>
<li>
<p><code>publish_result()</code> - Publish processing results</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"AI-284:AI+RabbitMQIntegration-EventProcessor(S3EventProcessor)"><=
strong>EventProcessor</strong> (<code>S3EventProcessor</code>)</h3>
<p><strong>Role</strong>: Event processing logic:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Validates message structure</p></li>
<li>
<p>Applies processing rules (bucket/folder/pattern matching)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Creates job metadata</p></li>
<li>
<p>Handles file movement and deletion logic</p></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Key Methods</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><code>process_file_created_event()</code> - Process FileCreated events</=
p></li>
<li>
<p><code>process_file_moved_event()</code> - Handle file moves during proce=
ssing</p></li>
<li>
<p><code>validate_message_structure()</code> - Validate incoming messages</=
p></li>
<li>
<p><code>create_processing_job()</code> - Create job from event data</p></l=
i>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"AI-284:AI+RabbitMQIntegration-CoreProcessor(MetagenProcessor)"><s=
trong>Core Processor</strong> (<code>MetagenProcessor</code>)</h3>
<p><strong>Role</strong>: Business logic processing <strong>Responsibilitie=
s</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Downloads files from S3</p></li>
<li>
<p>Performs actual AI processing (metadata extraction)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Returns processing results</p></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Key Methods</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><code>process_video()</code> - Process video files</p></li>
<li>
<p><code>process_image()</code> - Process image files</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"AI-284:AI+RabbitMQIntegration-7.ServiceOrchestrator(MetagenServic=
e)">7. <strong>Service Orchestrator</strong> (<code>MetagenService</code>)<=
/h3>
<p><strong>Role</strong>: Service coordination <strong>Responsibilities</st=
rong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Coordinates all components</p></li>
<li>
<p>Manages job queue and processing</p></li>
<li>
<p>Provides service health and status</p></li>
<li>
<p>Handles startup/shutdown</p></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Key Methods</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><code>startup()</code> - Initialize all components</p></li>
<li>
<p><code>_process_jobs()</code> - Background job processing</p></li>
<li>
<p><code>get_health()</code> - Service health status</p></li>
</ul>
