<h2 id=3D"AI-284:AI+RabbitMQIntegration-ErrorHandlingStrategy">Error Handli=
ng Strategy</h2>
<h3 id=3D"AI-284:AI+RabbitMQIntegration-MessageLevel">Message Level</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Invalid Structure</strong>: Reject without requeue =E2=86=92 Dea=
d letter</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Unknown Event Type</strong>: ACK and ignore</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Missing Required Fields</strong>: Reject without requeue</p></li=
>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"AI-284:AI+RabbitMQIntegration-ProcessingLevel">Processing Level</=
h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>File Not Found</strong>: ACK and skip (file may have been delete=
d)</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Processing Timeout</strong>: Retry with exponential backoff</p><=
/li>
<li>
<p><strong>Resource Exhaustion</strong>: Stop consuming temporarily</p></li=
>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"AI-284:AI+RabbitMQIntegration-SystemLevel">System Level</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>RabbitMQ Disconnect</strong>: Automatic reconnection with backof=
f</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>S3 Unavailable</strong>: Retry with exponential backoff</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"AI-284:AI+RabbitMQIntegration-KeyDesignDecisions">Key Design Deci=
sions</h2>
<h3 id=3D"AI-284:AI+RabbitMQIntegration-1.At-Most-OnceDelivery">1. <strong>=
At-Most-Once Delivery</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Single Notification API ensures no duplicate events</p></li>
<li>
<p>RabbitMQ consumer acknowledgment only after job creation</p></li>
<li>
<p>No need for S3 metadata state management</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"AI-284:AI+RabbitMQIntegration-2.JobLifecycleManagement">2. <stron=
g>Job Lifecycle Management</strong></h3>
