<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">WAITING=
 =E2=86=92 PROCESSING =E2=86=92 FINISHED/FAILED/CANCELLED</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 id=3D"AI-284:AI+RabbitMQIntegration-3.ResultPublishingOptions">3. <stro=
ng>Result Publishing Options</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>RabbitMQ</strong>: <code>rabbitmq://vision-metadata-xchg</code><=
/p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>HTTP</strong>: <code>https://external-api/callback</code></p></l=
i>
<li>
<p><strong>Both</strong>: Primary + Secondary destinations</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"AI-284:AI+RabbitMQIntegration-4.Configuration-DrivenProcessing">4=
. <strong>Configuration-Driven Processing</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Bucket/folder/pattern matching</p></li>
<li>
<p>Service-specific file type support</p></li>
<li>
<p>Tenant enablement/disablement</p></li>
</ul>
